### Scheduler validation for Mork write serialization
### Requires: VS Code REST Client extension
### Steps:
### 1) Fill @authToken and @spacePrefix.
### 2) Run "SSE Stream" first and keep it open.
### 3) Quickly run "Write A - Upload" and then "Write B - Clear".
### 4) In SSE output, confirm B reports waiting and completes after A.

@host=http://localhost:8000
@authToken=200003ee-c651-4069-8b7f-2ad9fb46c3ab
@spacePrefix=YOUR_TOKEN_NAMESPACE_PREFIX
@space={{spacePrefix}}scheduler-test

### SSE Stream (open first)
GET {{host}}/events
Accept: text/event-stream

### Optional: verify token is valid
GET {{host}}/token
authorization: {{authToken}}

### Write A - Upload (start this first)
POST {{host}}/spaces/upload/{{space}}
authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: text/plain

