### Expected SSE order (approx):
### - PROCESS_STARTED:UPLOAD
### - ...logs...
### - PROCESS_STARTED:CLEAR
### - Write queue busy, waiting for turn...
### - PROCESS_EXIT_SUCCESS (for first)
### - ...CLEAR logs...
### - PROCESS_EXIT_SUCCESS (for second)
